From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:34:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] unit: test tethering clients, also when tethering is turned
 off

test-tethering runs src/tethering.c with what it drives (bridge, NAT,
DHCP server, DNS proxy, rtnl, IPv6 prefix delegation) stubbed to
succeed, and a fake D-Bus connection: dbus_connection_send() and
dbus_connection_unref() are wrapped, so the test reads the
TetheringClientsChanged signal.

It registers and unregisters clients, and turns tethering off with three
connected, which must announce all three as removed and leave none
listed. Before "tethering: do not remove clients while walking the
client table" that aborts on GLib's
"g_hash_table_foreach: assertion 'version == hash_table->version'
failed", which g_test_init() makes fatal.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 Makefile.am           |  13 ++
 unit/test-tethering.c | 334 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 347 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 unit/test-tethering.c

diff --git a/Makefile.am b/Makefile.am
index f145c7d..db66854 100644
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -341,6 +341,19 @@ unit_test_dhcp_server_LDFLAGS = -Wl,--wrap=dhcp_l3_socket \
 
 TESTS += unit/test-dhcp-server
 
+noinst_PROGRAMS += unit/test-tethering
+
+# tethering.c as it is, with what it drives stubbed in the test and a fake
+# D-Bus connection whose signals the test reads.
+unit_test_tethering_SOURCES = $(backtrace_sources) src/log.c \
+				src/tethering.c unit/test-tethering.c
+unit_test_tethering_LDADD = gdbus/libgdbus-internal.la \
+				@GLIB_LIBS@ @DBUS_LIBS@ -ldl
+unit_test_tethering_LDFLAGS = -Wl,--wrap=dbus_connection_send \
+				-Wl,--wrap=dbus_connection_unref
+
+TESTS += unit/test-tethering
+
 if WISPR
 noinst_PROGRAMS += tools/wispr
 
diff --git a/unit/test-tethering.c b/unit/test-tethering.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7d8fe13
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unit/test-tethering.c
@@ -0,0 +1,334 @@
